      <h2>We're 100% artisanal</h2>
      <p>Everything we make is crafted by hand using traditional methods that honor the art of baking. There are no shortcuts in our kitchen, only dedication and skill.</p>
      <p>Our bakers knead each batch of dough with care, allowing natural fermentation to develop complex flavors that simply can't be rushed. We source premium flour from local mills, use real butter instead of substitutes, and let our sourdough starters mature for days to achieve that perfect tang and texture you can taste in every bite.</p>
      <p>From delicate croissants with their countless flaky layers to rustic country loaves with golden crusts, every item reflects genuine craftsmanship at its finest.</p>
      <p>We reject mass production and industrial techniques because we know that true quality comes from patience, expertise, and attention to detail.</p>
      <p>Our bakers have spent years mastering their craft, learning the subtle cues that separate good baking from exceptional results.</p>
      <p>When you choose our products, you're experiencing baking the way it was meant to be—authentic, wholesome, and made with pride by artisans who truly care about their work.</p>
    </article>
